+// Hallmark dense patch: c_0, the c of gains(), is RN32(sqrt(d) / 2^t), t the largest integer with
+// 4^t <= d, so that 1 <= c_0 < 2 (scales/README.md, "The exponent of each cell", step 2); for
+// attn_q it is sqrt(d) / 2^t / sqrt(dh), rounded once. As binary32 bit patterns, for the admitted
